stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Default
  state "Next automatic read loads all Home data" as Default
  state "Next read updates calendar only" as Agenda
  state "Full Home refresh waiting" as Full
  Default --> Agenda: Review decision succeeds
  Default --> Full: Click Refresh Home
  Agenda --> Agenda: Another review decision succeeds
  Agenda --> Full: Click Refresh Home
  Full --> Full: Another review decision succeeds
  Full --> Full: Click Refresh Home again
  Default --> Default: Start full read
  Agenda --> Default: Start calendar read
  Full --> Default: Start full read
  %% A waiting full Home refresh must not become a calendar-only read.
